        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best walking pad for tall people is one with at least 47 inches of belt, and the
            <strong class="text-white">WalkingPad Z1R</strong> is the most practical of them for a
